          "name": "Overview",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Overview",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Two seasons handled, one machine. The Yarbo Core with both the Snow Blower and Leaf Blower Modules. Clear leaves through fall and heavy snow through winter, without ever buying a second machine. No separate Core purchase required.<br/><br/>🍂 Fall: scheduled leaf and debris clearing.<br/>❄️ Winter: autonomous two-stage snow clearing.<br/>🔄 One Core, two modules, swapped in minutes.<br/></p>"
