        "collapsible_tab_Uf69Wz": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Product Information",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>Two Seasons Handled, One Machine</strong></p><p>This bundle pairs the Yarbo Core with both the Snow Blower and Leaf Blower Modules, so one machine clears leaves through fall and heavy snow through winter. No separate Core purchase required, and no second machine to buy when the season changes.</p><h3>Fall — Leaves Cleared on Schedule</h3><p>The Leaf Blower Module clears leaves and debris from lawns, paths, and hard surfaces on a schedule you set, keeping large properties tidy through the entire fall season without hours of manual work.</p><h3>Winter — Snow Cleared Before You Wake Up</h3><p>Swap to the Snow Blower Module and the same Core clears driveways and walkways autonomously, through the night if needed, so your property is ready before morning.</p><h3>Precision Navigation, No Boundary Wires</h3><p>RTK positioning, binocular vision, and multi-sensor fusion map your property to centimeter accuracy. A tracked drive and 70% (35°) climbing ability take on slopes and packed snow that stop wheeled machines.</p><h3>In the Box</h3><ul><li>Yarbo Core (autonomous tracked base)</li><li>Snow Blower Module</li><li>Leaf Blower Module</li><li>Battery, Docking Station, and accessories</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_X7L37G": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Warranty & Support",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Warranty & Support",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>2-year manufacturer warranty, extendable up to 5 years, with expert support behind it. Typically delivered in about two weeks after your order. This is a modular system that ships in multiple cartons; freight and delivery details are confirmed at checkout.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HjeTwa": {
          "type": "collapsible-tab",
          "name": "Setup & Installation",
          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Setup & Installation",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>No boundary wires. The Core maps your property on its first run, and modules swap in minutes as the seasons change, from Leaf Blower in fall to Snow Blower in winter.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        },
