            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Specifications",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p>Navigation: RTK + Vision + IMU + ODOM<br/><br/>Obstacle avoidance: Binocular camera + ultrasonic radar + bumper<br/><br/>Climbing ability: 70% (35°)<br/><br/>Drive system: Tracked<br/><br/>Connectivity: 4G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi HaLow<br/><br/>Includes: Core, Snow Blower Module, Leaf Blower Module, Battery, Docking Station, accessories<br/><br/>Warranty: 2 years, extendable up to 5<br/><br/></p>"
